    {
      "source": "Any XML files located in the classpath under the META-INF/spring-data-rest/ path will be automatically\nfound and loaded into this <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a>.",
      "translation": "位于类路径下 `META-INF/spring-data-rest/` 路径中的任何 XML 文件都将被自动发现并加载到该 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/context/ApplicationContext.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.context\"><code>ApplicationContext</code></a> 中。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/HandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerMapping</code></a> to delegate requests to Spring Data REST controllers. Sets up a\n<code>DelegatingHandlerMapping</code> to make sure manually implemented\n<a href=\"../BasePathAwareController.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>BasePathAwareController</code></a> instances that register custom handlers for\ncertain media types don't cause the <a href=\"../RepositoryRestHandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>RepositoryRestHandlerMapping</code></a> to be omitted. See DATAREST-490.",
      "translation": "将请求委托给 Spring Data REST 控制器的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/HandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerMapping</code></a>。配置一个<code>DelegatingHandlerMapping</code>，以确保手动实现的\n<a href=\"../BasePathAwareController.html\" title=\"annotation interface in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>BasePathAwareController</code></a> 实例（这些实例为特定媒体类型注册了自定义处理器）不会导致 <a href=\"../RepositoryRestHandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class in org.springframework.data.rest.webmvc\"><code>RepositoryRestHandlerMapping</code></a> 被省略。参见 DATAREST-490。",
      "count": 1
    },
    {
      "source": "The <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/HandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerMapping</code></a> to delegate requests to Spring Data REST controllers.",
      "translation": "将请求委托给 Spring Data REST 控制器的 <a class=\"external-link\" href=\"https://docs.spring.io/spring-framework/docs/7.0.8/javadoc-api/org/springframework/web/servlet/HandlerMapping.html\" title=\"class or interface in org.springframework.web.servlet\"><code>HandlerMapping</code></a>。",
